                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is a fun romp through space, a simple yet addictive game. \n\nPros: \n- Several different environments, each with a unique theme.\n- Various challenges and objectives\n- Catchy and engaging music\n- Good variety in ship customisation \n\nCons: \n- Whilst there is good variety in ship parts the customisation is a bit basic\n- Some of the objectives are quite simple. Always involving the collection of X or reaching X\n\nIn conclusion. The game is fun but not very deep, well priced and a nice relaxing experience.",
